Third-party material

This product bundles third-party material under its own licenses. The per-file list (what it
is, where it came from, its license status) is in ATTRIBUTION.md.

- The koala artwork in assets/brand/ was generated with an AI image tool. Its terms have not
  been verified, so it is NOT covered by the license above and NOT open source. See
  ATTRIBUTION.md. It must be replaced or cleared before any release that ships it.
- Noto Naskh Arabic, Noto Sans Hebrew and Noto Sans Devanagari (assets/fonts/) - SIL Open
  Font License 1.1, Copyright 2022 The Noto Project Authors. Bundled unmodified so that
  Arabic, Hebrew and Devanagari have glyphs on a machine that has no such font installed;
  each licence text sits beside its font as assets/fonts/OFL-*.txt.
- The window also uses the fonts bundled with egui, which carry their own licenses; those ship
  with the egui crates.
- Dependencies are listed in Cargo.lock, each under its own license. A license audit of them
  (for example with cargo deny) has not been run.
- The pictures in docs/images/ are screenshots of NoteCraft itself, made by its own test
  harness. They contain the koala artwork above.

The notes in docs/research/ paraphrase Microsoft's published specifications [MS-ONESTORE] and
[MS-ONE]. No Microsoft text, code or assets are included.
